    "atom::8f2d21d8fee37488d3078ceb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8f2d21d8fee37488d3078ceb",
      "source_handle": "P0220",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用系统性文献综述方法。1. **分类梳理**：将代谢物按功能分为促进肿瘤进展和抑制肿瘤进展两类，并按信号通路（MAPK, PI3K/Akt/mTOR, NFκB, Wnt/β-catenin）和免疫调节机制进行归类。2. **对比分析**：重点对比同一代谢物在不同癌症类型、不同浓度或不同免疫微环境下的相反作用（矛盾功能）。3. **临床转化关联**：将基础机制研究与临床治疗手段（放疗、化疗、免疫治疗）相结合，分析代谢物对现有疗法疗效和副作用的影响。4. **策略总结**：归纳基于代谢物调控的新型治疗干预措施及其优缺点。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c74ceafaf0f44d4428d1f44c9834e5d308c0933c5efca4ee53b7106017abb26b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2d0f32a438258de9f5a9f5a056ed472f9e88e8f22ea31e9f82bc2e2d8b91f0b0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::49ffd73edb65a3456c498074": {
      "atom_id": "atom::49ffd73edb65a3456c498074",
      "source_handle": "P0220",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物代谢物在癌症进展和治疗中作用的全面分类框架，详细列出了涉及的关键信号通路（MAPK, PI3K/Akt, NFκB, Wnt）和免疫细胞亚群。",
        "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究，未提供新的实验数据验证所有机制。对于某些代谢物的矛盾功能，原文指出需进一步探究因果机制，目前多为观察性关联。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c74ceafaf0f44d4428d1f44c9834e5d308c0933c5efca4ee53b7106017abb26b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::89ac28b1ef0277dcd2b98c9a21b851f8bc4faa681fdfe23dc947b7668ad7091e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::1dcffce52796ea372a267e47": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1dcffce52796ea372a267e47",
      "source_handle": "P0220",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "明确了特定代谢物（如SCFAs, LCA, Inosine, TMAO）在不同癌症类型和微环境条件下的双向调节作用，强调了情境依赖性。",
        "limits": "部分机制描述较为概括，例如TMAO的具体抗癌机制被标记为“尚未完全阐明”，且不同研究间可能存在异质性，综述未深入探讨这些差异的来源。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c74ceafaf0f44d4428d1f44c9834e5d308c0933c5efca4ee53b7106017abb26b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::89ac28b1ef0277dcd2b98c9a21b851f8bc4faa681fdfe23dc947b7668ad7091e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fc52ea176053f9bf9c00ccf7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fc52ea176053f9bf9c00ccf7",
      "source_handle": "P0220",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "总结了基于代谢物调控的新型治疗策略（饮食、噬菌体、FMT、合成生物学等），并评估了其优势和挑战。",
        "limits": "许多新型策略（如合成生物学工程菌、噬菌体联合疗法）仍处于早期研究阶段，临床应用的可行性和安全性尚待大规模临床试验证实。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c74ceafaf0f44d4428d1f44c9834e5d308c0933c5efca4ee53b7106017abb26b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::89ac28b1ef0277dcd2b98c9a21b851f8bc4faa681fdfe23dc947b7668ad7091e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f56da8af01dd158236d62743": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f56da8af01dd158236d62743",
      "source_handle": "P0220",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "生理浓度下；结肠癌",
        "finding": "短链脂肪酸（SCFAs，如丁酸盐）通过抑制组蛋白去乙酰化酶（HDAC）和激活GPCRs，抑制结肠癌进展，促进Treg分化，抑制Th17。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c74ceafaf0f44d4428d1f44c9834e5d308c0933c5efca4ee53b7106017abb26b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1f3d1e2fae71e5db3e9d2f048452981655a95559c6a38fe5f971ee6d85b62887",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2c694f52856386f670af88cb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2c694f52856386f670af88cb",
      "source_handle": "P0220",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "非酒精性脂肪肝相关肝细胞癌（NAFLD-HCC）；高浓度",
        "finding": "SCFAs水平显著升高时，可能超过宿主耐受阈值，通过增加Tregs比例和损害CD8+ T细胞功能，促进肿瘤进展。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c74ceafaf0f44d4428d1f44c9834e5d308c0933c5efca4ee53b7106017abb26b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1f3d1e2fae71e5db3e9d2f048452981655a95559c6a38fe5f971ee6d85b62887",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e3b83737f287b84dd75ba66d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e3b83737f287b84dd75ba66d",
      "source_handle": "P0220",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "存在外源性IFN-γ和共刺激信号",
        "finding": "肌苷（Inosine）结合T细胞表面的A2AR，促进Th1分化，增强抗肿瘤免疫。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c74ceafaf0f44d4428d1f44c9834e5d308c0933c5efca4ee53b7106017abb26b",
          "field_path": [
