    },
    "atom::d02da3469d5e3091aaa682f2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d02da3469d5e3091aaa682f2",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "purpose"
      ],
      "value": "举例说明免疫检查点的动态变化及其作为联合治疗靶点的潜力，特别是在那些对常规PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂反应不佳的“冷”肿瘤中。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "1",
            "purpose"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9dd5ef80f372870d5855d10ab03617e24a797f5e62f883f297344fd8c7973090",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2cddf71f714e8bd0b0742fd9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2cddf71f714e8bd0b0742fd9",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该研究未涉及肠道微生物组本身，因此不能直接回答微生物组如何调制ICB疗效的问题，仅能提供宿主细胞层面的平行机制或潜在交互作用的假设基础。",
        "contribution": "提供了核糖体生物合成活性在TME非癌细胞中异质性分布的证据，特别是高活性与免疫抑制性表型（如Tregs, MRC1+ TAMs）的正相关性。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::bcf9169c5b912b0c557fdac952c0b4bc5a078c1fe3e3b6b8f5ec9876a0cdb040",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::65cb5cad6de61c96623284b5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::65cb5cad6de61c96623284b5",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于解释肠道微生物组或其他代谢因素如何通过影响宿主免疫细胞的翻译能力来间接调节ICB疗效的背景讨论；或作为对比案例，说明除了微生物代谢产物外，宿主细胞内在的翻译机器状态也是重要调节维度。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::32af03d06d295867aa94f8a70466779480fe2cae9e0c4e21a3cfcc0d39326340",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2db2e1385752aeb5b9a7eb7b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2db2e1385752aeb5b9a7eb7b",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该机制针对的是LAG3而非PD-1/PD-L1，且依赖于特定的核糖体抑制剂。需明确区分这是宿主细胞内在机制，而非微生物介导的直接效应。",
        "contribution": "阐明了靶向核糖体生物合成（CX-5461）通过清除高核糖体活性的抑制性T细胞（HSP70+ CD8+ T）和Tregs，并诱导LAG3表达，从而增敏LAG3阻断疗法的机制。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::bcf9169c5b912b0c557fdac952c0b4bc5a078c1fe3e3b6b8f5ec9876a0cdb040",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::136bd8f9c79a4b7d13bf16a6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::136bd8f9c79a4b7d13bf16a6",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "直接用于回答“哪些机制介导了这种效应”中的非微生物机制部分。展示了通过调节细胞内在翻译状态来改变免疫检查点表达和消除抑制性细胞的具体路径。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::32af03d06d295867aa94f8a70466779480fe2cae9e0c4e21a3cfcc0d39326340",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::acf814180f2022f7f59bec9a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::acf814180f2022f7f59bec9a",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于“非癌细胞核糖体功能在肿瘤免疫逃逸中的作用”及“代谢/翻译机器作为免疫治疗增敏靶点”的重要实证素材。其核心价值在于打破了仅关注癌细胞核糖体的局限，指出了TME中特定免疫亚群（HSP70+ CD8+ T, MRC1+ TAMs）的高核糖体活性是免疫抑制的关键特征，并证明了通过CX-5461靶向这一过程可逆转免疫抑制并增敏LAG3阻断疗法。这为解释ICB耐药机制及开发联合策略提供了新的视角。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b61e475b79c48483791d41a6ad1e615850478f1ba3e1b0685bb9e1b8ecb1814e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e1de468fe274f9a526506909": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e1de468fe274f9a526506909",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究主要关注核糖体生物合成抑制剂CX-5461，其机制可能与其他核糖体靶向药物不同，外推时需谨慎。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::de193a817fa5af5315fbb7d3ed7f650eccdd87049a3e07038534f249ac996eb5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2a65d07ed3bd9d7164c5711e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2a65d07ed3bd9d7164c5711e",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "发现的HSP70+ CD8+ T细胞亚群及其高核糖体活性主要在结直肠癌和小鼠模型中验证，在其他实体瘤中的普遍性有待进一步确认。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::de193a817fa5af5315fbb7d3ed7f650eccdd87049a3e07038534f249ac996eb5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::927d79908788b76d4f8a85ec": {
      "atom_id": "atom::927d79908788b76d4f8a85ec",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "LAG3的诱导和增敏效果是在CT26（微卫星稳定）模型中观察到的，不能直接推广到所有MSI-H肿瘤或所有免疫检查点组合。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::de193a817fa5af5315fbb7d3ed7f650eccdd87049a3e07038534f249ac996eb5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::65949bf4bf380a79853edee4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::65949bf4bf380a79853edee4",
      "source_handle": "P0580",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "核糖体状态签名是基于NMF算法构建的计算指标，虽经多项验证，但仍需结合其他独立方法确认其在不同平台数据中的稳健性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5f35d65e992214fe2688905acd5293501aef3c04672830bf52ef3308e86149fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::de193a817fa5af5315fbb7d3ed7f650eccdd87049a3e07038534f249ac996eb5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
