    "atom::716085725aeb9de14276347d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::716085725aeb9de14276347d",
      "source_handle": "P0579",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "1. 动物模型与治疗：使用 Ksp1.3-CreER^T2; Vhl^fl/fl; Trp53^fl/fl; Rb1^fl/fl (VpR) 小鼠诱导 ccRCC，给予抗 PD-1 + 抗 CTLA-4 单药或联合 PT-2385 (HIF-2α 抑制剂)、Acriflavine (HIF-1α/2α 抑制剂)、Cabozantinib (TKI)、Cisplatin 或 anti-Gr-1 抗体治疗，通过 MRI 监测肿瘤生长曲线。2. 免疫表型分析：利用流式细胞术和免疫组化定量分析肿瘤微环境中 CD8+ T 细胞、调节性 T 细胞、髓系细胞（MDSCs, TAMs）及活化标志物的频率和密度。3. 功能验证：建立匹配的小鼠 ccRCC 细胞系与冷冻脾脏淋巴细胞共培养体系，检测 T 细胞活化状态（IFN-γ, GZMB, PD-1）。4. 单细胞转录组学：对 VpR 肿瘤进行 scRNA-seq，结合人类 TCGA 和 CPTAC 数据进行跨物种比较，重点分析髓系细胞亚群特征及免疫检查点配体（如 Lgals3, Lgals9, Pvr, Cd276 等）的表达谱。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f5279671fd44e5c2d6abcf8983dc1c0f2d330d3a727583c7d3c713c0ac749d57",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b5508708b94d63c4703895b021f5a96c4e1cb9bef0ff060bdd9de306b1f4e575",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::315ea8f977ef94fc62c980b0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::315ea8f977ef94fc62c980b0",
      "source_handle": "P0579",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了一个高度模拟人类 ccRCC 遗传背景和免疫微环境的自发性小鼠耐药模型，证实了 PD-1/CTLA-4 靶向治疗在该模型中的无效性。",
        "limits": "模型不产生转移灶，无法研究转移性病变的免疫特征；RB1 突变在人类 ccRCC 中罕见，模型基因型可能仅反映部分人类病例的特征；样本量有限，部分统计结果未达到显著性水平。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f5279671fd44e5c2d6abcf8983dc1c0f2d330d3a727583c7d3c713c0ac749d57",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8cad83a81cfb8656246e7fe13a37048df848134b287809de9e40760cf6f346b1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ff35e35972d2579f765dff2a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ff35e35972d2579f765dff2a",
      "source_handle": "P0579",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "揭示了肿瘤微环境中髓系细胞介导的局部免疫抑制是阻碍 ICI 疗效的关键因素，并提出了替代检查点靶点的理论依据。",
        "limits": "基于相关性分析和体外共培养推断机制，缺乏针对特定新靶点（如 Galectin-3 或 TIM-3）的功能性阻断实验来直接验证其因果作用。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f5279671fd44e5c2d6abcf8983dc1c0f2d330d3a727583c7d3c713c0ac749d57",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8cad83a81cfb8656246e7fe13a37048df848134b287809de9e40760cf6f346b1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c07b925079fa1ae911db4f9c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c07b925079fa1ae911db4f9c",
      "source_handle": "P0579",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "VpR 小鼠接受抗 PD-1/CTLA-4 单药或联合 HIF 抑制剂、TKI、化疗或去髓系治疗",
        "finding": "所有治疗方案均未显著改变肿瘤生长速率，表明该模型对当前主流 ccRCC 免疫联合疗法具有原发性耐药性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f5279671fd44e5c2d6abcf8983dc1c0f2d330d3a727583c7d3c713c0ac749d57",
