    "atom::da325f138c6f3bbc0a84e418": {
      "atom_id": "atom::da325f138c6f3bbc0a84e418",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "empirical",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::30ee35dc0681e791369c1f977791139f5f05a4e8bb8eac3d0239d9472b0c6d56",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::613aedf2e6dd4a2fba3fcb02": {
      "atom_id": "atom::613aedf2e6dd4a2fba3fcb02",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管ICI在MSI-H/dMMR结直肠癌中有效，但在更常见的MSS mCRC中疗效有限，其耐药机制尚不完全清楚。近期研究发现肿瘤微环境中的EPCs可通过分泌Artemin发挥免疫抑制作用。本研究试图验证Artemin是否作为MSS mCRC患者对ICI治疗反应性和预后的生物标志物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c187405d04c9bf0d4da320bd0e69d53d619656e6178e78de344882cac9f11459",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a7b5fe215751de15980f2dfb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a7b5fe215751de15980f2dfb",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "微卫星稳定型转移性结直肠癌（MSS mCRC）患者，基于加拿大癌症试验组（CCTG）CO.26 II期临床试验的回顾性相关分析。研究对象为接受度伐利尤单抗联合曲美木单抗（D+T）或最佳支持治疗（BSC）的患者血清样本。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f07bd5a0a8b58e7946469ef39d72dfaf73936d6830b096a4d7c9e1f782b74be2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::011f940198126db6c7b3457a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::011f940198126db6c7b3457a",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探讨肿瘤微环境中红细胞祖细胞（EPCs）分泌的神经营养因子Artemin与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效及预后的关系。通过对CO.26试验中161名有血清样本患者的基线及治疗期间Artemin水平进行分层，分析其对无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）的影响。结果显示，高基线Artemin是不良预后标志物，且可能预测ICI治疗的获益；治疗期间Artemin水平的升高与疾病进展相关。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d7e4230cc63bde431061f1201270f6feb6fb8e102c0cb747bb8ae77fa99f4618",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8ae9b356022a65ad0679bcec": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8ae9b356022a65ad0679bcec",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "CO.26试验数据显示，在未经选择的MSS mCRC人群中，双免疫治疗的整体获益有限，且存在明显的异质性（由Artemin水平区分）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::07f7078e4340cc2961ba5a3c83b06279661927a07d99b7a8dc907b6c2eee5628",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::548bf099022d728ac2e9fc80": {
      "atom_id": "atom::548bf099022d728ac2e9fc80",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "connection_to_review"
      ],
      "value": "用于论证为什么需要寻找生物标志物来筛选适合ICI治疗的MSS患者，从而引出对肠道微生物组等预测因子的探索必要性。说明当前领域面临的挑战：单一疗法在MSS中效果不佳，需精准分层。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
