      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该机制聚焦于血液/肿瘤微环境中的神经营养因子，不涉及肠道菌群代谢产物或定植竞争。不能直接外推为微生物组的作用，但可作为解释MSS CRC异质性的另一维度。",
        "contribution": "揭示了通过神经营养因子Artemin介导的免疫抑制微环境机制。具体而言，EPCs分泌Artemin可能与ICI耐药有关，高基线Artemin预示不良预后，且治疗期间升高提示进展。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b3f73d4ac066091303ea3f7edf11292aea56dd221e9e6f8743c80d46da828b06",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4ef3104915d714862338378b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4ef3104915d714862338378b",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于综述中讨论“除了肠道微生物组之外，还有哪些肿瘤微环境成分或旁分泌信号通路影响ICI疗效？”的部分。作为微生物组之外的独立或竞争性机制进行阐述。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f49900a3657d2aeaf843972b397702ebc86cdd3a8608d5670e4cdaa2d9424cd0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::00d8fcd3ca808ce9c56f952f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::00d8fcd3ca808ce9c56f952f",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了MSS结直肠癌中非微生物组的免疫抑制机制（EPC-Artemin轴）的具体案例。虽然不直接回答肠道微生物组的作用，但可作为“其他宿主/肿瘤微环境因素调节ICI疗效”的重要对比素材或背景，用于讨论为何某些MSS患者对ICI无反应，以及除微生物组外的替代或协同耐药机制。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fe309c733d2760a080a6c2551c679864bf8c80190304096175448469fcf16cba",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::764b06cfff1671308269aafd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::764b06cfff1671308269aafd",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究针对的是MSS mCRC，而非所有实体瘤或所有类型的结直肠癌。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::72e2c8de8cb20757b63a3d5d5b60ee304f5825d75cce555efe6ad29704c69a03",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2eb50962b3439280e9e7319b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2eb50962b3439280e9e7319b",
      "source_handle": "P0581",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "Artemin作为预测标志物的效力基于事后分析，交互作用p=0.061，属于趋势性发现，不能作为确证的临床决策依据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7cb0101bff5b55d60160d56f5ecafe52106c12cea56e111e08fc335b6f7c244",
          "field_path": [
