      "source_handle": "P0587",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的ADA1策略主要针对CAR T细胞，虽然机制上可能与ICI有交集（如都受TME代谢影响），但不能直接推断其对ICI疗效的影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f91812ead0c570146868b193015805c6d1a9b8a6339997e95ccf6f84bf1619e9",
