      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2e7e44778f62616ccf6d1299": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2e7e44778f62616ccf6d1299",
      "source_handle": "P0589",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "在综述中讨论“如何测量或监测肿瘤微环境变化以评估治疗反应”时，可作为技术背景或对照模型的有效性证据。说明研究者可以利用此类模型来观察治疗前后的代谢改变。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fb52b3621e1fe1f515eb59106e26772ff4abbab4d4d6339018f2e44cd8c5270",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::efc95cbb8dfe6436cf83af1b79f4cd93fe6e01663a7a71cea5536d607997bf42",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f4b0744258ca3d9dbcf2f69b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f4b0744258ca3d9dbcf2f69b",
      "source_handle": "P0589",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "虽然犬尿氨酸途径与色氨酸代谢有关（而色氨酸代谢常受微生物影响），但本文未建立其与微生物或免疫调节机制的联系。仅描述了其在不同肿瘤类型中的差异性分布。",
        "contribution": "识别了ATP、肌苷和犬尿氨酸代谢物作为肿瘤微环境代谢活性的潜在指标。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fb52b3621e1fe1f515eb59106e26772ff4abbab4d4d6339018f2e44cd8c5270",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::760d429b849a7f87b027130e6632f92d912382bf0f80ce9703088693c2f400ba",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e3f88a7f9b0983340eaa2e1f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e3f88a7f9b0983340eaa2e1f",
      "source_handle": "P0589",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "若综述涉及“肿瘤代谢产物对免疫微环境的影响”，可引用此发现作为某些代谢物（如犬尿氨酸衍生物）在肿瘤中富集的背景信息，提示其可能参与局部免疫抑制或能量竞争，但需明确这仅是相关性描述，非因果机制证明。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fb52b3621e1fe1f515eb59106e26772ff4abbab4d4d6339018f2e44cd8c5270",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::efc95cbb8dfe6436cf83af1b79f4cd93fe6e01663a7a71cea5536d607997bf42",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::419197c79f3befbd612f6352": {
      "atom_id": "atom::419197c79f3befbd612f6352",
      "source_handle": "P0589",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文主要提供了一种用于评估实体瘤微环境代谢活性的技术平台（体内微透析+PDX模型），并确认了PDX模型在保留人类肿瘤代谢特征方面的有效性。对于综述主题“肠道微生物群如何调节实体瘤中免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效”，本文的直接证据有限，但可作为背景材料，说明在评估ICI疗效时，肿瘤局部的代谢微环境（如能量消耗标志物）是一个重要的考量维度，且PDX模型是研究这种局部效应的合适工具。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fb52b3621e1fe1f515eb59106e26772ff4abbab4d4d6339018f2e44cd8c5270",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2621317e45eadd4f1d242d78f293d871a3fc66055ac7cbd13cf3d85fd03302db",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::21aaca27c8e32b9655a7d3fc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::21aaca27c8e32b9655a7d3fc",
      "source_handle": "P0589",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "本文未直接研究肠道微生物群或免疫检查点抑制剂，因此不能直接回答F1和F2的核心问题。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fb52b3621e1fe1f515eb59106e26772ff4abbab4d4d6339018f2e44cd8c5270",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4a0fb8a7dda79b40cde8e71092b8d263d0a9964eff37e6e3e45ab5179cf8b98d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::291614a8aeead9fa318f875f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::291614a8aeead9fa318f875f",
      "source_handle": "P0589",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "提到的“犬尿氨酸代谢物”虽与免疫调节有关，但本文未探讨其免疫学功能，仅作为代谢标志物提及。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fb52b3621e1fe1f515eb59106e26772ff4abbab4d4d6339018f2e44cd8c5270",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4a0fb8a7dda79b40cde8e71092b8d263d0a9964eff37e6e3e45ab5179cf8b98d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c0b478c0ec06ef5196357bf7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c0b478c0ec06ef5196357bf7",
      "source_handle": "P0589",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "结论基于PDX模型，外推到人类患者时需考虑模型局限性（如缺乏完整的免疫系统重建，除非特别说明）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1fb52b3621e1fe1f515eb59106e26772ff4abbab4d4d6339018f2e44cd8c5270",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4a0fb8a7dda79b40cde8e71092b8d263d0a9964eff37e6e3e45ab5179cf8b98d",
