      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::93c6a2bc5ca1c43be2fd189fb473aa761e120adadfbb9d47d57314ce2ef6769a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b93ff14cc5f4d46546ef31600a3adce12951ecaa3889db70a8d9b6515244a961",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::326bcdfc7c44333ca4ea1aa5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::326bcdfc7c44333ca4ea1aa5",
      "source_handle": "P0588",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管临床前研究表明肠道微生物代谢物肌苷可增强ICI疗效，但缺乏人体临床证据。本研究试图解决肌苷作为辅助治疗是否能提高晚期实体瘤患者对PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂的响应率及生存获益的问题。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::93c6a2bc5ca1c43be2fd189fb473aa761e120adadfbb9d47d57314ce2ef6769a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::943a699b97c27b086fe1e293c15d24019adbaac6c35cdf0fd026b666479adfd1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::96c8a6d462cf5ee52975af40": {
      "atom_id": "atom::96c8a6d462cf5ee52975af40",
      "source_handle": "P0588",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "单中心、前瞻性、随机、开放标签的II期临床试验。研究对象为晚期恶性实体瘤患者（包括肺癌、消化道肿瘤等），干预措施为在PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂基础上联合口服肌苷（0.2g，每日三次），对照组仅接受PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂±靶向±化疗。主要评估终点为客观缓解率（ORR）、无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::93c6a2bc5ca1c43be2fd189fb473aa761e120adadfbb9d47d57314ce2ef6769a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b9e05159a22e0b03543e7c2b0effe6e4731f3014e2276ede76bb24a041163815",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1351c9ffeb3960925c4ddd82": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1351c9ffeb3960925c4ddd82",
      "source_handle": "P0588",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在验证肠道微生物代谢物肌苷能否增强免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在晚期实体瘤中的疗效。研究在北京友谊医院开展，将172名患者随机分配至肌苷组或对照组。结果显示，与对照组相比，肌苷组显著延长了中位PFS（7.00 vs 4.40个月，HR=0.63, p=0.011），ORR呈上升趋势但未达统计学显著性（26.7% vs 15.1%, p=0.061），OS两组无显著差异。亚组分析显示肌苷在多种基线特征下均能改善PFS。安全性方面，肌苷组3-4级不良反应发生率略低于对照组。结论认为肌苷有潜力增强ICI疗效并降低相关不良反应。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::93c6a2bc5ca1c43be2fd189fb473aa761e120adadfbb9d47d57314ce2ef6769a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::bb5f2c911553ead3a9435d59120d0e9750c88da31097513828752b24ec9b1936",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1f23585217c274f414ef0eb4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1f23585217c274f414ef0eb4",
      "source_handle": "P0588",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了肌苷（一种已知的肠道微生物代谢物）在人体中增强ICI疗效的直接临床证据。对于综述而言，它是连接“肠道菌群代谢物”与“ICI疗效”的关键实证环节，特别是填补了从动物实验到人类临床应用的空白。其核心价值在于展示了具体代谢物干预的临床可行性、剂量方案及初步疗效信号，同时揭示了不同肿瘤类型和炎症状态下的异质性响应。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::93c6a2bc5ca1c43be2fd189fb473aa761e120adadfbb9d47d57314ce2ef6769a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b39f8bc5a9bd4d273800a133a4887507808572f5a449f9e91e6f0d827a3ce904",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c624786259f743d00b397b1b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c624786259f743d00b397b1b",
      "source_handle": "P0588",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅在PFS上显示显著优势，ORR和OS未达到统计学显著性；结果受限于单中心和混合肿瘤类型，不能直接外推至所有实体瘤或替代一线标准疗法的地位。",
        "contribution": "提供了肌苷作为肠道代谢物增强ICI疗效的人体临床数据。具体表现为：在全队列中显著延长PFS（HR=0.63），在肺癌亚组中大幅延长PFS（HR=0.45），并在特定炎症指标（低PLR/NLR，高LDH/ENR）亚组中表现出更显著的PFS获益。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::93c6a2bc5ca1c43be2fd189fb473aa761e120adadfbb9d47d57314ce2ef6769a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::69636b46f2c3a0f1970ce1bd748a3765ff7ddf179fdb78b70ca618c1e394a8f1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::bd7cf9ee9784dc464dd54081": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bd7cf9ee9784dc464dd54081",
      "source_handle": "P0588",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物如何调节ICI疗效”中的“临床效应”部分。可作为具体代谢物干预成功的案例，证明某些菌群代谢产物确实能在人体内转化为治疗增益。可用于讨论哪些患者亚群（如特定炎症背景）可能从代谢物补充中获益最大。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::93c6a2bc5ca1c43be2fd189fb473aa761e120adadfbb9d47d57314ce2ef6769a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2f3fe7d15655f5c57ef626c950729ca6d5131350a87c226f26b0830c45137bf2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::7fc145947c92c1b9b4e13c3f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7fc145947c92c1b9b4e13c3f",
      "source_handle": "P0588",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制部分主要基于作者引用的既往文献（Mager et al., Wang et al., Zhang et al.），本文本身未提供新的机制实验数据（如生物样本分析）。因此，机制解释属于理论支撑，而非本研究的直接发现。",
        "contribution": "虽然本文主要报告临床结果，但在背景和讨论中引用并整合了机制研究：肌苷通过抑制UBA6增加肿瘤细胞免疫原性、激活IFN-γ/TNF-α通路、促进CD8+ T细胞增殖、抑制MDSC介导的免疫抑制以及作为CD8+ T细胞的碳源。这些机制解释了为何肌苷能克服ICI耐药。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::93c6a2bc5ca1c43be2fd189fb473aa761e120adadfbb9d47d57314ce2ef6769a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::69636b46f2c3a0f1970ce1bd748a3765ff7ddf179fdb78b70ca618c1e394a8f1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ce8b4ad67e8ec6c6ca41a0b5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ce8b4ad67e8ec6c6ca41a0b5",
      "source_handle": "P0588",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“介导该效应的机制是什么”。提供具体的分子和细胞机制链条，说明肠道代谢物如何通过重塑肿瘤微环境（TME）和增强T细胞功能来协同ICI。有助于解释临床观察到的PFS延长背后的生物学基础。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::93c6a2bc5ca1c43be2fd189fb473aa761e120adadfbb9d47d57314ce2ef6769a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2f3fe7d15655f5c57ef626c950729ca6d5131350a87c226f26b0830c45137bf2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
