    "atom::309f1460bfa5781083656af4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::309f1460bfa5781083656af4",
      "source_handle": "P0593",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "如何在复杂的肿瘤微环境中系统性地识别能够增强免疫疗法疗效的药物组合？目前缺乏量化药物诱导TME重塑的系统框架，且难以预测哪些非抗癌药物可作为免疫治疗的增效剂。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cad57877901956b6a5b266004ef71ba19dcff7577bfdbe1e882a3afda48c9090",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::732cd6b3522e68e0af8deae5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::732cd6b3522e68e0af8deae5",
      "source_handle": "P0593",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究聚焦于实体瘤（以小鼠结肠癌CT26模型和人类膀胱癌队列为主）的肿瘤微环境（TME），探讨药物诱导的TME重塑如何影响免疫检查点抑制剂（如抗PD-1/PD-L1）的疗效。研究对象包括8种癌症类型的TCGA数据、739种免疫调节化合物、小鼠体内的单细胞转录组数据以及临床回顾性队列。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::14676627b0abede06869fb7b73e943549a4d14c7379bcf358e0c3ebb48285c96",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::82ddeb3927993c2d17aa2d61": {
      "atom_id": "atom::82ddeb3927993c2d17aa2d61",
      "source_handle": "P0593",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在解决缺乏系统性框架来量化药物诱导的TME重塑的问题。作者首先通过TCGA数据和ImmuCellAI算法鉴定了肿瘤细胞特异性免疫浸润调节基因（TIIMGs），并利用L1000平台筛选出能显著调控这些基因的化合物。随后，在小鼠CT26肿瘤模型中，通过单细胞RNA测序（scRNA-seq）分析了多种药物处理后的TME变化，识别出12个与TME重塑相关的元程序（Meta-programs, MPs）。基于MP富集情况开发了MP评分算法，用于量化TME对药物的响应程度。该算法成功鉴定出别嘌醇（Allopurinol, AP），一种痛风药物，发现其能通过促进肌苷（inosine）的合成与分泌，上调肿瘤细胞的MHC I类和PD-L1表达，从而增强CD8+ T细胞的杀伤活性。在体内实验中，低剂量AP联合抗PD-1治疗实现了4/6的小鼠完全肿瘤清除。此外，一项包含50名膀胱癌患者的回顾性研究显示，接受抗痛风药物治疗的患者在抗PD-1治疗下的总生存期显著优于未使用者。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::391eceded1ecf56ae5d091a90b59deb3028cc3018ca386d838c6a3de3ec793d2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8ef9500030daca139659e570": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8ef9500030daca139659e570",
      "source_handle": "P0593",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于‘非传统免疫调节药物’（老药新用）如何通过代谢重编程和TME重塑增强ICI疗效的具体案例和机制解释。它不直接涉及肠道菌群，但提供了一个重要的对比维度：即宿主代谢状态（如痛风药物干预）和肿瘤局部代谢产物（肌苷）如何独立于或协同于微生物组影响ICI疗效。其建立的MP评分框架可用于归类不同药物对TME细胞组成的影响模式。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0d9edc12952e25ea3827e182d9745f7c9087385ae20293656a81cc807142d46a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::29799ff01275a5961dfa4b1f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::29799ff01275a5961dfa4b1f",
      "source_handle": "P0593",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该研究未涉及肠道菌群，因此不能直接回答菌群如何调制ICI疗效的问题，只能作为平行机制或交互作用的潜在背景。",
        "contribution": "提供了非微生物来源的代谢物（肌苷）增强ICI疗效的证据。研究发现别嘌醇通过增加肌苷分泌，增强CD8+ T细胞功能，这与某些肠道菌群代谢产物（如丁酸盐、次级胆汁酸）调节免疫微环境的机制形成互补或对比视角。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
