    "atom::3512f2955467a09b6cb866ee": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3512f2955467a09b6cb866ee",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "当前文献中大量外周血生物标志物被错误地解释为预测免疫治疗响应的工具，而实际上它们主要反映疾病负担或宿主生理状态（预后因素）。如何从概念上和方法学上严格区分真正的预测性生物标志物与预后噪声，以指导精准免疫治疗？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::056dcdc5cd13c4d287d248dbba95b1b12235017e153d6468a4764414508e552f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::340ff9883e037c437b68438b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::340ff9883e037c437b68438b",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "PD-1/PD-L1免疫治疗中的外周血生物标志物，涵盖肿瘤来源、免疫细胞来源、可溶性炎症介质及新兴技术平台。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fedae07ec7e9962d1406f47656704755d58615b309c2ac0e0287bb3c2b4ca350",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6ef0a7018c5ded08d04d7842": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6ef0a7018c5ded08d04d7842",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述旨在解决外周血生物标志物在临床转化中面临的预测价值与预后价值混淆的问题。作者提出一个基于机制的框架，将生物标志物分为静态与动态、预测性与预后性，并系统评估了各类标志物的生物学合理性、临床适用性及转化障碍。文章强调区分反映肿瘤负荷和全身炎症的预后标志物（如基线ctDNA、NLR）与直接反映免疫检查点阻断响应机制的动态免疫信号（如早期ctDNA清除、CD8+ T细胞激活），并探讨了复合模型和纵向监测的未来方向。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ab6dd18ec76b87fdb9f34a2ceeaeea1d24d6a6752473728f8e83d149aa5a3e5f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::041a2154cbb93c6d4054df38": {
      "atom_id": "atom::041a2154cbb93c6d4054df38",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "论文第2节提出的‘预测性vs预后性’概念框架，以及图1所示的解释框架。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
