    },
    "atom::eb0422b6459df27ce41f3db9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::eb0422b6459df27ce41f3db9",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "本文未直接提供微生物组调节ICI疗效的具体生物学通路细节，仅提供了解读此类关联的方法论框架。",
        "contribution": "提供了评估外周血标志物（包括微生物代谢物）临床相关性的通用标准：即必须证明其与特定治疗（ICI）的交互作用，而非仅与生存期相关。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fb85a58ca38f6670bf815e309d1444db0900a2af030ba11ca6aa157f68941aa8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d20df7e1a0bbde1c90636cba": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d20df7e1a0bbde1c90636cba",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于判断关于肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效的研究是否建立了真正的预测关联，还是仅仅反映了患者的整体健康状况（预后）。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::15c919af51e93edf4d68bc19d3ae632e5b643f7219b93874446e8f7b6c6a6f78",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::bc92ec9b757931a5e3a517b5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bc92ec9b757931a5e3a517b5",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "本文未详细阐述微生物组如何通过抗原呈递或T细胞代谢具体介导效应，仅指出微生物产物进入血液循环调节免疫的可能性。",
        "contribution": "指出了系统性炎症、宿主生理状态和肿瘤负荷作为混杂因素的风险，这些因素可能同时影响微生物组成和免疫治疗反应。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fb85a58ca38f6670bf815e309d1444db0900a2af030ba11ca6aa157f68941aa8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3344fc5fcac8c268d50a6ca1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3344fc5fcac8c268d50a6ca1",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "在解释微生物组与ICI疗效之间的关联时，提示需要控制这些潜在的混杂变量，避免将相关性误认为因果机制。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::15c919af51e93edf4d68bc19d3ae632e5b643f7219b93874446e8f7b6c6a6f78",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::085f55df7a7cbd3b19396c7b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::085f55df7a7cbd3b19396c7b",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文虽未深入展开肠道微生物的具体分子机制，但其关于“外周血生物标志物”的分类框架和局限性讨论，为理解微生物代谢物（如SCFAs）作为外周血标志物的性质提供了重要的参照系。它帮助识别微生物衍生标志物在当前证据链中的位置（探索性、易受混杂因素影响），并强调了区分预后与预测的重要性，这对于评估微生物干预对免疫检查点抑制剂疗效的影响至关重要。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::92ad9e8799a77b07dbe56a6ec96277e2a5e2372447e17cef01edb953c5b91093",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::68f6c6238063e8ac1d84de14": {
      "atom_id": "atom::68f6c6238063e8ac1d84de14",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该论文主要关注PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂，虽然提及实体瘤，但未专门针对所有类型的免疫检查点抑制剂（如CTLA-4）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4c848525060fe05d47675ec71173f01df22b20b29da1cdd4e45d893442523eac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::5c4f2795ddb9fc8f6978f9c0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5c4f2795ddb9fc8f6978f9c0",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "论文强调微生物衍生标志物目前处于‘探索性’阶段，不应将其视为已验证的预测工具，这与综述中可能引用的某些积极发现形成对比，需在综述中平衡呈现。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4c848525060fe05d47675ec71173f01df22b20b29da1cdd4e45d893442523eac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2543023523a63a049610f188": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2543023523a63a049610f188",
      "source_handle": "P0591",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "论文指出的‘预后噪声’概念提醒我们，观察到的微生物组与疗效的相关性可能部分源于患者的一般健康状况或肿瘤负荷，而非微生物本身的直接药理作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::54f28890ea704080b8c5ab58bc4e5568bf7b967b94983a9bf7c7a7a790b2d837",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4c848525060fe05d47675ec71173f01df22b20b29da1cdd4e45d893442523eac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
