          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2419c8cb7f18c08b1a8fc9b8dfc2f67975442011413c7a612b491b7d43550154",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2d2113bc89d1d369caa99f74": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2d2113bc89d1d369caa99f74",
      "source_handle": "P0592",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "如何改变PDAC肿瘤微环境的免疫景观，使其对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）敏感？具体而言，CAFs在介导免疫抑制中的作用是什么，以及如何通过联合治疗（如IL-15与化疗）改善这一状况？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::81a463e17c47335f75f1bad1e3dfd53a26e503e28ee99506046ac36b6eb3f94a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0166cfacf6d579ea47d90a712339c32011c45fe26aa6bf55a9e42119498c6e25",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6afdda0455ba5a9a0f2cd853": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6afdda0455ba5a9a0f2cd853",
      "source_handle": "P0592",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "胰腺导管腺癌（PDAC）肿瘤微环境（TME），重点研究癌症相关成纤维细胞（CAFs）对免疫浸润的影响，以及IL-15联合化疗对该环境的调节作用。研究对象为体外构建的3D异型球体模型，包含PDAC患者来源的肿瘤细胞、原代或永生化CAFs及健康供体外周血单个核细胞（PBMCs）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::81a463e17c47335f75f1bad1e3dfd53a26e503e28ee99506046ac36b6eb3f94a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3daf394b6bb1d61e3c37083ca68fc34b725352d5eb75a07b770e0f95fee2d85a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9c87fe8e8545aabf2609b10c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9c87fe8e8545aabf2609b10c",
      "source_handle": "P0592",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在解决PDAC因致密基质和免疫抑制微环境导致免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效不佳的问题。作者开发了一种包含肿瘤细胞、CAFs和PBMCs的3D异型球体模型，以模拟复杂的癌-基质相互作用。通过流式细胞术、成像质谱细胞术和免疫组化对模型进行表征，证实CAFs促进肿瘤生长并抑制免疫浸润。研究发现，IL-15治疗能显著促进PBMCs向球体内浸润，并增加CD4+、CD8+ T细胞、gDelta T细胞和NK细胞的比例。当IL-15与吉西他滨联合使用时，进一步增强了免疫效应细胞的浸润及其活化状态（表现为IFNγ、CD107a和Granzyme B等标志物增加），从而产生抗肿瘤效应。该模型被证明适用于表征CAFs对治疗效果的影响及免疫抑制机制。后续计划开展体内实验验证该策略对抗PD1治疗的增敏作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::81a463e17c47335f75f1bad1e3dfd53a26e503e28ee99506046ac36b6eb3f94a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::74aa206b433450062ec6f9edc022492edabdf82b6aee880a842178e779945930",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::24b9a22cf54314a58e470cb5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::24b9a22cf54314a58e470cb5",
      "source_handle": "P0592",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "CAFs促进肿瘤生长、耐药并抑制免疫浸润的描述；IL-15联合化疗改善免疫浸润的数据。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::81a463e17c47335f75f1bad1e3dfd53a26e503e28ee99506046ac36b6eb3f94a",
          "field_path": [
